# This directory holds rendered .mbox and .cert-cc.txt files staged for
# human dispatch. Per ADR-0014 the disclosure pipeline never auto-sends;
# the operator reviews these files and dispatches via their own MUA.
#
# This directory is intentionally part of the engineering-private repo
# tree. The public-sanitized export must NOT include anything under
# this path (see sanitize-check Rule 7 forthcoming).
